t":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Uninstall:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Workspace configuration"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Create `.dsh/dshmm/mcp.json` at the workspace root:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Rules:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- A missing `type` is treated as Streamable HTTP; `${VAR}` environment expansion is supported.\n- A s"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"tdio server without `cwd` uses the workspace root.\n- `serverName` is globally unique; duplicates are"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" shown as conflicts.\n- Set `\"enabled\": false` to disable an entry without removing it; absent means "},{"id":"p21s4","text":"s conflicts.\n- Set `\"enabled\": false` to disable an entry without removing it; absent means enabled."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Behavior and limits"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- Workspace tools use the `mcp__<serverName>__<tool>` naming convention.\n- Settings strict mode is u"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"sed to mount only the selected workspace's servers."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Source developers"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"When modifying both deepseek-harness and this plugin from source, see the Source Developer Guide. Bo"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"th repositories may be anywhere; they do not need to be siblings or use fixed paths."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Design notes live in `Doc/requirements.md`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
